                                    <div id="14-day-warning" class="row">
                        <div class="col-xl-1 col-md-2 col-xs-4">
                            <img src="/Content/Images/ExclamationPoint.jpg" alt="exclamation point">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-xl-11 col-md-10 col-xs-8">
                            Because the next election is within the next 14 days, registering to vote through this website won't allow you to vote in the upcoming election. You can still vote in the upcoming election but you will need to take additional steps. Here’s how:
                            <a href="/Home/RegisterToVote/#how" data-mce-href="~/Home/RegisterToVote/#how">Registering to Vote within 14 Days of Election</a>
                        </div>
